        <p><seg source="#source-68760-68766">この</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68766-68781"><rb>篇</rb><rt>へん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-68781-68784">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68784-68826"><rb>飾馬考</rb><rt>かざりうまかんがへ</rt></ruby>』『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68832-68962"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-94-18" source="#source-68832-68879">驊</g><g ref="#gaiji-3-1-94-16" source="#source-68879-68926">騮</g><seg source="#source-68926-68932">全書</seg></rb><rt>くわりうぜんしよ</rt></ruby>』『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68968-69007"><rb>武器考證</rb><rt>ぶきかうしよう</rt></ruby>』『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69013-69055"><rb>馬術全書</rb><rt>ばじゆつぜんしよ</rt></ruby>』『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69061-69103"><rb>鞍鐙之辯</rb><rt>くらあぶみのべん</rt></ruby>』『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69109-69175"><rb>春日神馬繪圖及解</rb><rt>かすがしんばゑづおよびげ</rt></ruby>』『<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69181-69211"><rb>太平記</rb><rt>たいへいき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69211-69214">』</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69214-69229"><rb>及</rb><rt>およ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69229-69232">び</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69232-69262"><rb>巣林子</rb><rt>さうりんし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69262-69265">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69265-69289"><rb>諸作</rb><rt>しよさく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69289-69292">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69292-69304"><rb>憑</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69304-69307">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69307-69325"><rb>所</rb><rt>ところ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69325-69340"><rb>多</rb><rt>おほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69340-69343">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-69343-69358"><rb>敢</rb><rt>あへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-69358-69361">て<